page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">???&#160;Coins</span></abbr></span></div></div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Lowest <abbr title=\"Buy It Now price\">BIN</abbr><br />(Daily Average)</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<span data-auction-house=\"eyJvcGVyYXRpb24iOiJpdGVtUHJpY2UiLCJ0eXBlIjoiYXZlcmFnZSIsImNvaW4iOnRydWUsIml0ZW1JZCI6IlJBTkRPTV9DRU5UVVJZX0NBS0VfUEFDSyJ9\" class=\"auction-house-data-placeholder auction-house-data-operation-itemPrice\"><abbr title=\"This content is populated from a JavaScript gadget, LivePriceData. If it does not load right away, check that the gadget is enabled in your preferences, reload the page, and contact an administrator if the issue persists or occurs regularly.\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">???&#160;Coins</span></abbr></span></div></div></div><div class=\"group\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(1, 1fr);grid-column:1 / -1\"><div class=\"infobox-header\">Item Metadata</div><div class=\"infobox-row-container\"><div class=\"infobox-row-label\">Item ID</div><div class=\"infobox-row-value\">\n<code>RANDOM_CENTURY_CAKE_PACK</code></div></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Random Century Cake Bundle</b> is a <span data-sort-value=\"4\"><a href=\"/w/Rarity#Legendary\" title=\"Rarity\"><span class=\"hsw-gamefont raritytier\"><span class=\"color-gold\" style=\"\">LEGENDARY</span></span></a></span> item.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Obtaining\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Obtaining</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Usage\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Usage</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Game_Message\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Game Message</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Obtaining\">Obtaining</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle?section=1&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Obtaining\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle?action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Obtaining\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The <b>Random Century Cake Bundle</b> can be obtained from <a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\">Raffle of the Century</a> event.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle?section=2&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Usage\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle?action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Usage\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The player could right-click a <b>Random Century Cake Bundle</b> to grant themselves <span class=\"color-light&#95;purple\">5</span> random <a href=\"/w/Century_Cake\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Century Cake\">Century Cakes</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Game_Message\">Game Message</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle?section=3&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Game Message\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle?action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Game Message\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Condition\n</th>\n<th>Message\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Not enough inventory space\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-c\">Oops! You need room for 5 cakes in your inventory to open this!</span></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Opening\n</td>\n<td><div class=\"mcdialogue\" style=\"\"><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-e\">You opened a </span><span class=\"format-6\">Random Century Cake Bundle</span><span class=\"format-e\"> and obtained:</span></div><div class=\"mcdialogue-line\"><span class=\"format-7\">&lt;cakes&gt;</span></div></div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle?section=4&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: Trivia\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle?action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: Trivia\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li>During the Year 300 <a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\">Raffle of the Century</a> <a href=\"/w/Alpha_Hypixel_Network\" title=\"Alpha Hypixel Network\">Alpha Testing</a> there were <span class=\"color-red\">500x</span> <b>Random Century Cake Bundle</b> in the <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Firework_Rocket.png/18px-Firework_Rocket.png?3a9e9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Firework_Rocket.png/36px-Firework_Rocket.png?3a9e9 2x\" data-file-width=\"160\" data-file-height=\"160\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/w/Raffle_of_the_Century\" title=\"Raffle of the Century\"><span class=\"color-red\"><b>The Big One</b></span></a>.</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"History\">History</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle?section=5&amp;veaction=edit\" title=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-divider\"> | </span><a href=\"/w/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle?action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section&#039;s source code: History\"><span>edit source</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<table class=\"wikitable pixelated\" data-description=\"History\"><tbody><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/Alpha_Hypixel_Network\" title=\"Alpha Hypixel Network\">Alpha Hypixel Network</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2023/August_31\" title=\"Changelog/2023/August 31\">Aug&#160;31,&#160;2023</a></th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Random_Century_Cake_Bundle_(Old).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle_%28Old%29.png/26px-Random_Century_Cake_Bundle_%28Old%29.png?775df\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle_%28Old%29.png/52px-Random_Century_Cake_Bundle_%28Old%29.png?775df 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span> Added <b>Random Century Cake Bundle</b>.</td></tr><tr><th colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/w/SkyBlock_Prototype\" title=\"SkyBlock Prototype\">SkyBlock Prototype</a></th></tr><tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/w/Changelog/2023/September_2\" title=\"Changelog/2023/September 2\">Sep&#160;2,&#160;2023</a></th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Random_Century_Cake_Bundle_(Old).png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle_%28Old%29.png/26px-Random_Century_Cake_Bundle_%28Old%29.png?775df\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle_%28Old%29.png/52px-Random_Century_Cake_Bundle_%28Old%29.png?775df 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span> Added <b>Random Century Cake Bundle</b>, as seen in the items API.</td></tr>\n<tr><th rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"2\">Sep&#160;7,&#160;2023</th><td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/w/File:Random_Century_Cake_Bundle.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"/images/thumb/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle.png/26px-Random_Century_Cake_Bundle.png?f5848\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Random_Century_Cake_Bundle.png/52px-Random_Century_Cake_Bundle.png?f5848 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"300\" /></a></span> Changed <b>Random Century Cake Bundle</b> texture.</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mediawiki‐jobrunner‐847db4cdb‐w42tb\nCached time: 20261023052104\nCache expiry: 172800\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐